# The login program's sign-in (docs/adr/0020-oxy-account-login.mdx): an enrolled Oxy account's
# password, checked as the system checks one at a login (its verifier, offline, by pam_unix), the
# account checked, and the person's session opened as a login opens one: its login uid, limits,
# environment and locale, and logind's session on the seat (pam_systemd, required: a session that
# logind does not know gets no seat). Installed as /etc/pam.d/oxyos-login.
@include common-auth
@include common-account
session required pam_loginuid.so
session optional pam_keyinit.so force revoke
session required pam_limits.so
session required pam_env.so readenv=1
session required pam_env.so readenv=1 envfile=/etc/default/locale
session required pam_unix.so
session required pam_systemd.so
